  'Details of Offer': 'Detalji ponude',
  'Start your journey with ': 'Započnite put uz ',
  ': market monitoring, analysis & support': ': praćenje tržišta, analiza i podrška',
  'Sign up, verify your identity, and add funds swiftly. Benefit from portfolio tracking, AI trading assistance, and a guided experience that leads you clearly from your first login to your dashboard.': 'Registrirajte se, potvrdite identitet i uplatite sredstva u nekoliko koraka. Praćenje portfelja, AI podrška i vođeni put od prve prijave do nadzorne ploče.',
  'Our service offers guided onboarding, full access to market tools, and ongoing assistance. We provide a straightforward and transparent path from registration to everyday trading without shortcuts.': 'Nudimo vođeni onboarding, puni pristup tržišnim alatima i stalnu pomoć. Jednostavan, transparentan put od registracije do svakodnevnog trgovanja, bez prečaca.',
  'A minimum deposit unlocks all platform features. Explore AI-driven strategies, manage risk controls, and track your portfolio\'s progress.': 'Minimalna uplata otključava sve značajke. Istražujte AI strategije, upravljajte rizikom i pratite portfelj.',
  'A minimum deposit unlocks all platform features. Explore AI-driven strategies, manage risk controls, and track your portfolio’s progress.': 'Minimalna uplata otključava sve značajke. Istražujte AI strategije, upravljajte rizikom i pratite portfelj.',
  'Always check fees, withdrawal times, and verification steps as shown on the platform. We aim to give you operational control: limits, position sizing, and manual options remain accessible even when automated alerts are active.': 'Uvijek provjerite naknade, rokove isplata i korake verifikacije na platformi. Zadržavate operativnu kontrolu: limiti, veličina pozicije i ručne opcije ostaju dostupni i uz automatske alarme.',
  'Support explains how ': 'Podrška objašnjava kako radi ',
  ' operates and transaction status; it does not give personalised advice. Markets carry risk: consider your exposure carefully and trade only with money you can afford to lose.': ' i status transakcija; ne daje osobne savjete. Tržišta nose rizik: procijenite izloženost i trgujte samo novcem čiji gubitak možete prihvatiti.',
  'Effortless Onboarding': 'Jednostavan onboarding',
  'Effortless account creation, identity confirmation, and transparent dashboard access.': 'Jednostavno stvaranje računa, potvrda identiteta i jasan pristup nadzornoj ploči.',
  'AI Support & Markets': 'AI i tržišta',
  'Built-in analytics, automated signals, and multi-market availability in one platform.': 'Ugrađena analitika, automatski signali i pristup više tržišta na jednoj platformi.',
  'Clear Customer Support': 'Jasna korisnička podrška',
